      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    principal = 200000\n    monthly_interest_rate = 0.0033\n    periods = 20 * 12\n\n    # Calculate the monthly annuity payout\n    if monthly_interest_rate == 0:\n        monthly_payout = principal / periods\n    else:\n        monthly_payout = (\n            principal\n            * monthly_interest_rate\n            * (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** periods\n            / ((1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** periods - 1)\n        )\n\n    # Return the payout rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(monthly_payout)\n```",
